## 7) Anti-patterns (avoid)

- Flat **`KpmgBeyondXxx Template/Folder/Rendering Parameters`** YAML at `templatesProject/kpmg/` root instead of under **`KPMG Beyond/{Name}/`**.
- **Datasource Template** as a GUID when all other KPMG Beyond renderings use **path strings**.
- **Datasource Location** querying **`@@name='KpmgBeyondXxxSections'`** instead of **`@@templatename='Xxx Section Folder'`**.
- **Folder template** without **`__Masters`** on standard values — authors cannot insert datasource items.
- Creating **`__Standard Values.yml`** without **`__Standard values`** on the parent template in the **same creation step**.
- Adding the parent link **only after a CM pull** — wire it in serialized YAML from the start (see §3.1.1 / Event Card Folder).
- Empty or self-referential **`__Standard values`** on the std-values item itself.
- Child templates parented to the **kpmg project folder** instead of the **branch root**.
- Registering the component in **`component-map.ts`** but forgetting **Available Renderings** or **placeholder settings**.
- **Templates + rendering only** — no site Data folder, sample datasource, or **`Home.yml` layout wiring** (§3.3).
- Site Data folder using **generic folder template** instead of **`{Short Name} Folder`** GUID.
- Child/grandchild renderings (tabs, cards, tiles) **not added** to `__Final Renderings` under the correct nested `s:ph` path.
- Skipping **`serialization validate --fix`** after moving or renaming template YAML.
- Wrong **folder template GUID** on site Data folder items (causes push/insert-option failures).
- **`Data.yml` using a non-existent Template Section GUID** — always `e269fbb5-3750-427a-9149-7aa950b49301` (§3.1.2); never guess a similar-looking `e269fbb5-…` ID.
